**Straight line** = frequency zero (no oscillation)
**Circle** = single frequency in two perpendicular directions
**Spiral** = circle + linear progression
**Flower** = radius oscillating while rotating
**Complex curves** = many frequencies superimposed

**In generative art:**
- Choose frequencies
